#: ../../../core-api/cgroup:7: ../kernel/cgroup/dmem.c:823
msgid "Find the first common ancestor of two pools."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core-api/cgroup:7: ../kernel/cgroup/dmem.c:829
msgid "``struct dmem_cgroup_pool_state *a``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core-api/cgroup:7: ../kernel/cgroup/dmem.c:824
#: ../kernel/cgroup/dmem.c:825
msgid "First pool to find the common ancestor of."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core-api/cgroup:7: ../kernel/cgroup/dmem.c:826
msgid "``struct dmem_cgroup_pool_state *b``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core-api/cgroup:7: ../kernel/cgroup/dmem.c:827
msgid ""
"The first pool that is a parent of both **a** and **b**, or NULL if either "
"**a** or **b** are NULL, or if such a pool does not exist. A reference to "
"the returned pool is grabbed and must be released by the caller when it is "
"done using the pool."
msgstr ""
